==Requirements==
Player must own a usable glide-trainable [[ride]] to complete this quest.
==To Start==
Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
==Goals==
Bounce through the fiery hoop above the launch pad outside of Sanctuary while on your untrained glide-trainable ride.
*Bounce through the Sanctuary hoop
*Return to Troy Ridewrangler
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"The first step in training a ride is to ensure that the ride understands what it is that you want to teach.<br />Go to the launch pads outside of Sanctuary and jump through the fiery hoop above while riding your untrained glide-trainable ride." -Troy Ridewrangler
#Bounce through the Sanctuary hoop
#*While on your ride bounce on the specific launch pad near the [[Sanctuary]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]], aim for the middle of the pad.
#Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"Good job! Your ride's understanding of your commands has been transferred to the Training Saddle!<br />Training is hard work. Come back tomorrow and we can continue the training!" -Troy Ridewrangler
